        "width": 640,
        "height": 120,
        "content": "### 1. Add and convert\nPaste file links in the form. Apify converts them to Markdown chunks with page numbers. Needs a **Header Auth** credential: `Authorization` = `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
